# Fetal-fraction reference peaks. As of v0.6.2 the 72 public-ENCODE DNase-seq
# source BEDs (data/access_ff/, hg19 4-col narrowPeak + encode_accessions.json)
# ARE shipped so the curated73 atlas is fully reconstructable offline; the 73rd
# track (neutrophil) ships under data/neutrophil_dnase/. The bulky _raw staging
# dirs and the unused histone_ff tracks remain out (re-fetchable via
# scripts/fetch_ff_atlas_beds.py).
